---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Production Base"
  description="Reusable Astro and Payload production infrastructure."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-5 py-20 text-center sm:px-8 sm:py-28">
    <p class="eyebrow">Production foundation</p>
    <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-6xl">
      Ready for product development.
    </h1>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600">
      Astro, Payload CMS, PostgreSQL, media, authentication, rich text, and
      cPanel deployment are configured as a reusable base.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
